7. Term and termination

Review rights end when the recipient breaches this license. Licensed-use rights
end when the applicable Valid Commercial License or executed agreement expires
or terminates. Sections intended by their nature to survive—including ownership,
restrictions, warranty disclaimers, and reserved rights—survive termination.

